      "SALLY: Heather works in my office and she is a lawyer.\nHEATHER: I hear you studied law.",
      "JESS: I can’t take your money.\nHEATHER: Hey how’s it going?",
      "JESS: No, no. That’ll be nice.\nHEATHER: You sure. Sally’s dying to talk to you. She claims she wasn’t properly introduced by you know who.\nJESS: See you in a bit.\nSALLY: Hey, how are you?",
      "SALLY: You expect me just to take that?\nJESS: What’s wrong?",
      "JESS: Let me see those.\nSALLY: I don’t understand? If someone was here why would they hide?\nJESS: These are my keys.\nSALLY: Why don’t they help us?"
    ]
